<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Moving with Kids and Elderly Jamshedpur | Family Shifting Guide | 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What specific advantages do professional movers provide when relocating families with kids and elderly in Jamshedpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Professional movers bring trained staff, child‑friendly handling, and senior‑specific care such as priority bedroom setup and medical kit isolation. They use GPS‑tracked trucks, 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, and offer IBA‑approved GST billing, ensuring safety, compliance, and a stress‑free experience for all family members.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I obtain an accurate moving quote for a Delhi‑to‑Mumbai family shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by sharing your inventory, distance (≈1,499 km via NH 19), and required services (packing, loading, door‑to‑door). Reputable movers will calculate charges based on volume, weight, and any special handling for kids or seniors. The final quote includes GST, insurance, and any optional add‑ons, giving you full cost transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is it important to set up a senior bedroom first during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A senior bedroom setup minimizes disorientation and ensures essential items—medicines, mobility aids, and personal belongings—are immediately accessible. This reduces stress, prevents accidents, and provides a familiar environment, which is crucial for elderly comfort during a long‑distance relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should be included in the essential 3‑day travel bag for kids and elderly?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pack medicines, basic toiletries, a change of comfortable clothing, favorite snacks, entertainment items for children, and essential documents. For seniors, include hearing aids, glasses, a small pillow, and any assistive devices. Keeping these items handy prevents last‑minute searches and eases the transition.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I ensure my sofa set and other bulky items are transported safely and cost‑effectively?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Choose movers who offer specialized multi‑car trailers with hydraulic ramps and custom wooden crates. Ask for a detailed charge breakdown that includes &quot;sofa set transport by train charges&quot; if rail is used, and verify insurance coverage. Proper padding and secure lashing prevent damage during the 1,500 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim GST on my moving expenses, and how does IBA approval help?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, moving services that provide a GST‑compliant invoice are eligible for claim. IBA‑approved movers follow standardized billing practices, making it easier for corporate or government employees to submit reimbursement claims. This ensures tax compliance and reduces administrative hassle.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the key steps for quiet packing execution to avoid disturbing children during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Schedule packing during low‑noise hours, use soft‑close boxes, label each container clearly, and employ silent loading equipment. Communicate the packing timeline to children, involve them in simple tasks, and keep a quiet play area. This approach maintains a calm environment while ensuring items are securely packed.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
